{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y把X中简短、有辨识度的情绪标题改成了较长的完整句子，尤其S01、S05这类停留较短的段落，第一眼扫读的轻快感明显下降。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势是标题短、节奏清楚，扫屏时很容易捕捉情绪落点，但不少关键动机和心理转折放在小字里，普通观众容易只看到情绪结论，不明白人物为什么这样。Y把动机、顾虑、期待和反复退缩都放进了大字，人物从怕增加对方负担，到怕失去亲近，再到接受无法保证永远的心理变化更加连贯，也更容易感受到其中的细微层次。整体而言，Y的理解效果更好，代价是牺牲了一部分屏幕文字的轻盈和诗意。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0978df11-dc09-40e6-869d-12095013c41e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190031425044Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:01:29.478552+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ffb8d3bb8d4185cfad85ab9b5a09c52b6ff323d2b84724bc2ca0d9dba4e21128", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w